    $$ \text{Rate in} = C_{in}(t) \times r_{in} = \frac{1}{4}\left(1 + \frac{1}{2} \sin t\right) \times 2 = \frac{1}{2}\left(1 + \frac{1}{2} \sin t\right) = \frac{1}{2} + \frac{1}{4} \sin t $$

