    $$ \frac{1}{4!} \binom{8}{3, 1, 1, 1, 1} = \frac{1}{24} \times \frac{8!}{3!1!1!1!1!} = \frac{1}{24} \times \frac{40320}{6} = \frac{6720}{24} = 280 $$
